  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.3",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et surrexit Jonas, ut fugeret in Tharsis a facie Domini, et descendit in Joppen: et invenit navem euntem in Tharsis, et dedit naulum ejus, et descendit in eam ut iret cum eis in Tharsis a facie Domini.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.4",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dominus autem misit ventum magnum in mare: et facta est tempestas magna in mari, et navis periclitabatur conteri.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.5",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et timuerunt nautæ, et clamaverunt viri ad deum suum, et miserunt vasa quæ erant in navi, in mare, ut alleviaretur ab eis; et Jonas descendit ad interiora navis, et dormiebat sopore gravi.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.6",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et accessit ad eum gubernator, et dixit ei: Quid tu sopore deprimeris? surge, invoca Deum tuum, si forte recogitet Deus de nobis, et non pereamus.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.7",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dixit vir ad collegam suum: Venite et mittamus sortes, et sciamus quare hoc malum sit nobis. Et miserunt sortes, et cecidit sors super Jonam.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.8",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dixerunt ad eum: Indica nobis cujus causa malum istud sit nobis: quod est opus tuum? quæ terra tua, et quo vadis? vel ex quo populo es tu?",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.9",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dixit ad eos: Hebræus ego sum, et Dominum Deum cæli ego timeo, qui fecit mare et aridam.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.10",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et timuerunt viri timore magno, et dixerunt ad eum: Quid hoc fecisti? cognoverunt enim viri quod a facie Domini fugeret, quia indicaverat eis.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.11",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dixerunt ad eum: Quid faciemus tibi, et cessabit mare a nobis? quia mare ibat, et intumescebat.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "clementine/jonah#Jonah.1.12",
    "work_id": "clementine/jonah",
    "canonical_ref": "Jonah.1.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dixit ad eos: Tollite me, et mittite in mare, et cessabit mare a vobis: scio enim ego quoniam propter me tempestas hæc grandis venit super vos.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
